Forward Hedge Proceeds:$$\text{Proceeds\_Forward} = \text{FC\_AMT} \times \text{F0\_in}$$Money-Market Hedge (Three-Step Pipeline):Borrow FC today:$$\text{Borrow\_FC} = \frac{\text{FC\_AMT}}{1 + \text{R\_FC} \times \left(\frac{\text{T\_DAYS}}{360}\right)}$$Convert at spot:$$\text{USD\_Spot\_Now} = \text{Borrow\_FC} \times \text{S0\_in}$$Invest in USD:$$\text{Proceeds\_MM} = \text{USD\_Spot\_Now} \times \left(1 + \text{R\_USD} \times \left(\frac{\text{T\_DAYS}}{360}\right)\right)$$Option Hedge (Put Floor):$$\text{Proceeds\_Option} = \text{FC\_AMT} \times \max(\text{S\_T}, \text{K\_PUT}) - (\text{FC\_AMT} \times \text{PREM\_PUT})$$
